<title>RUSSIA: Russian 154-day bill auction delayed.</title>
<headline>Russian 154-day bill auction delayed.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of 4.00 trillion roubles of 154-day GKO discount Treasury bills on Wednesday was delayed because of technical problems, a Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) official said.</p>
<p>Bids for the series 22066 bills received up to 11.29 a.m. Moscow time (0829 GMT) would be accepted, and further bids would be accepted until about 2.15 p.m. (1115), he said.</p>
<p>The Finance Ministry is also offering 7.50 trillion roubles of 266-day bills on Wednesday. This auction, taking place later, has not been affected by the technical problems.</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
